{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:32.586Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Ingredient Sourcing | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216192983616","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Where the ingredients in your private label supplements come from. Decades of supplier relationships, country-of-origin transparency, branded ingredient access.","name":"Private Label - Page - Ingredient Sourcing","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-ingredient-sourcing","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:42:18.960Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-ingredient-sourcing","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">QUALITY</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Where the ingredients in your products come from.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Decades of supplier relationships, ingredient sourcing networks, and supplier vetting procedures. The quality of your finished product traces back to where the ingredient was grown, extracted, or synthesized.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608888,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Most supplement brands can't tell you where their ingredients come from. We can.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Ingredient sourcing is where supplement quality is built or broken. We have decades of supplier relationships, country-of-origin documentation, and vetting procedures for every raw material in our catalog.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">When customers ask your brand 'where does this come from,' you can provide answers with documentation behind them. That level of transparency is increasingly rare in the supplement market and increasingly valuable for brand trust.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216201608889,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Decades of supplier relationships</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Many of our ingredient suppliers have been with us for 10, 20, or 30+ years. Long-term relationships drive consistent quality and supply chain reliability.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 0 0 0-18m0 18a9 9 0 0 1 0-18m0 18c2.07 0 3.75-4.03 3.75-9S14.07 3 12 3m0 18c-2.07 0-3.75-4.03-3.75-9S9.93 3 12 3M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Country-of-origin transparency</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">We document where each ingredient is sourced and can provide that information for your brand's marketing and customer communication.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.04L9.34 4.7l-3.94.34a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.36 1.36L3.7 10.34 2.7 12l1.04 2.66.34 3.94c.13.7.65 1.23 1.36 1.36l3.94.34L9.66 21.3 12 22.3l2.66-1.04 3.94-.34a1.69 1.69 0 0 0 1.36-1.36l.34-3.94 1.04-2.66-1.04-2.66-.34-3.94a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.36-1.36l-3.94-.34L12 2.7Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Branded ingredient access</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Direct relationships with branded ingredient producers (Tonalin, Cognizin, Bioenergy Ribose, Curcumin C3 Complex, etc.) give you access to ingredients that have clinical research behind them.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608960,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608961,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218949791241,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":4,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608963,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Where do your ingredients come from?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Different ingredients come from different places depending on where the highest-quality source exists. Botanical ingredients often come from India, China, or specific U.S. regions depending on the plant. Vitamins and minerals come from major suppliers in the U.S., Europe, and Japan. We disclose country of origin on request for every ingredient.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do you use branded ingredients (Curcumin C3, NKO, Sensoril, etc.)?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We have supplier relationships with most major branded ingredient companies. Branded ingredients add cost but give you marketing leverage (the brand story, the published research, the certifications). We help you decide where branded ingredients are worth the premium.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How do you verify ingredient quality from suppliers?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Three layers: supplier qualification (audits, documentation, history), incoming raw material testing (identity, potency, contaminants on every lot), and process verification during manufacturing. We don't release any finished product unless every ingredient passes our incoming tests.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I specify or change ingredient sources?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">For private label, you use the sources we've qualified for each formulation. For custom formulation, you can specify branded ingredients or alternative sources, subject to our qualification and stability testing. We give you transparency on what's available and what tradeoffs are involved.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are your ingredients sustainably sourced?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Many are. For botanicals specifically, we look at sustainability and ethical sourcing practices as part of supplier qualification. For some ingredients we have specific sustainable or fair-trade certified sources available at slight premiums. We can guide you toward sustainability-positioned options where they exist.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608964,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950233520,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":7,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}